I checked org.apache.kafka.connect.mirror.MirrorMaker#configureConnector which then calls org.apache.kafka.connect.runtime.distributed.DistributedHerder#putConnectorConfig, and I don't really see any sign of forwarding to the leader. The callback of the validation explicitly handles the non-leader state with a failure:
