In <3.6.0-rc0, duplicates of a plugin would be shown if it subclassed multiple interfaces. For example:
{noformat}
  {
    "class": "org.apache.kafka.connect.storage.StringConverter",
    "type": "converter"
  },
  { 
    "class": "org.apache.kafka.connect.storage.StringConverter",
